MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: List with a Form sub-page (ActivityEditor). C++ (ActivitiesModule), ActivityConfig, KAuthorized check, delete prompt and
all stored values unchanged. Not built yet.

Moved / renamed:
- List rows show icon, name and a small subtitle ("Current activity" or the activity description); delete is a ToolButton
  with tooltip and Accessible.name (kcm_activities/configureActivity, isNewActivityAuthorized). Placeholder when empty.
- "Create New…" became "Add Activity…", kept visible (kcm_activities/CreateNew); old wording in ia/layout.json aliases.
- Editor: Icon, Name, Description, then "Shortcut for switching:" (used more often than the permissions), then a section
  "While this activity is active" with three plain checkboxes: "Track files and apps used", "Turn off the screen
  automatically", "Shut down or sleep automatically" (were "While on this activity, allow:" + Tracking file and app use /
  Automatically turning off the screen / Automatically shutting down or sleeping; inverted bindings kept) (settings-isPrivate,
  settings-inhibitScreen, settings-inhibitSleep, settings-shortcut). The empty spacer Item became nothing.
HIG ids: HIG-001/005/006 (order by use), HIG-057 (no generic section), button labels with ellipsis when they open something.

Speed cause (kcm_activities.cpp): nothing blocking; load() only handles a launch argument via singleShot(0). The activity list
comes from Activities.ActivityModel in the view, so the page shows before data arrives. KGlobalAccel D-Bus happens on Save only
(activityconfig.cpp). After numbers: pending, manager will measure.

Unconfirmed: the ActivityModel role names "current" and "description" (model lives in libkactivities, not in src/master); a
missing role reads as undefined and the subtitle is just hidden. Not compiled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
